{
  "name": "PCA9685",
  "description": "NXP PCA9685 16-channel 12-bit PWM Fm+ I²C LED controller. Matches Zephyr drivers/pwm/pwm_pca9685.c (MODE1/2, LEDn_ON/OFF, PRE_SCALE).",
